  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cancer App for school kids to detect cancer early</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the Cancer Smart App is to educate school children about all cancer that often remains undetected in young adults due to the diverse society in South Africa, where cultural taboos, stigmas and a lack of knowledge about the subject is widespread.    Due to the household situation in South Africa one child will reach up to another 7 people at home with the information we provide at schools. We need US$ 1.10 to educate a child about the importance to detect cancer early.</narrative>
  </description>
